<title>USA: ABN AMRO Chicago wins Maryland-National Capital.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO Chicago wins Maryland-National Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Chicago Corp said it won $33 million of the Maryland-National Capital Park and Planning Commission Prince George's County Park Acquisition and Development bonds, Series T-2.</p>
</text>
